  "intro": {
    "title": "Stunde or Uhr?",
    "paragraphs": [
      "These words measure time. All are easy except one pair: eine Stunde is an hour as a length of time, but drei Uhr is three o'clock. Ich warte eine Stunde, but der Kurs beginnt um drei Uhr.",
      "Mind the genders: Tag and Monat are masculine, Woche, Minute, Sekunde and Stunde feminine, Jahr neuter."
    ]
  },
  "sampleSentences": [
